{"id":"0fc577c79c699e0c","group":"58","path":"58/batch05/58-df-class-elementary-embedding.md","title":"Class Elementary Embedding Schema","display":"df-class-elementary-embedding — Class Elementary Embedding Schema","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-class-elementary-embedding","aliases":["58-df-class-elementary-embedding"],"display":"df-class-elementary-embedding — Class Elementary Embedding Schema","depends_on":["[[../batch11/58-df-class.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","[[58-df-class-satisfaction.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","[[../batch10/58-df-ordclass.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-class-elementary-embedding"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-class-elementary-embedding</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-class-elementary-embedding — Class Elementary Embedding Schema"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ca2a9c9166fa8cce\" href=\"?note=ca2a9c9166fa8cce\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-class.md\">../batch11/58-df-class.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9976e7d9d98187f6\" href=\"?note=9976e7d9d98187f6\" title=\"58-df-class-satisfaction.md\">58-df-class-satisfaction.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"1d8adfba370086ed\" href=\"?note=1d8adfba370086ed\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-ordclass.md\">../batch10/58-df-ordclass.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,N,j\\in\\mathsf{Cls}\">\\(M,N,j\\in\\mathsf{Cls}\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_{\\in}\">\\(\\mathcal L_{\\in}\\)</span> (the first-order language of set theory)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_{\\in})\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_{\\in})\\)</span> (formula set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Class}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Class}_S\\)</span> (definable-class predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"ca2a9c9166fa8cce\" href=\"?note=ca2a9c9166fa8cce\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-class.md\">../batch11/58-df-class.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ElementaryClassEmbedding}^{\\mathrm{sch}}_S\\subseteq\\mathsf{Cls}^3\">\\(\\operatorname{ElementaryClassEmbedding}^{\\mathrm{sch}}_S\\subseteq\\mathsf{Cls}^3\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bigwedge_{\\varphi}\">\\(\\bigwedge_{\\varphi}\\)</span> 是元语言模式，按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"9976e7d9d98187f6\" href=\"?note=9976e7d9d98187f6\" title=\"58-df-class-satisfaction\">58-df-class-satisfaction</a> 的有限公式递归解释每一个成员结构满意式；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash_{\\mathrm{meta}}\">\\(\\vdash_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\)</span> 不是 ZFC 中的统一类真谓词。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j(a)\">\\(j(a)\\)</span> 表示类函数图中唯一的像；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi(v_0,\\ldots,v_{n-1})\">\\(\\varphi(v_0,\\ldots,v_{n-1})\\)</span> 限定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}_{\\mathcal L_\\in}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{v_i:i&lt;n\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{FV}_{\\mathcal L_\\in}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{v_i:i&lt;n\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ClassElementaryEmbedding}_S(j,M,N)\">\\(\\operatorname{ClassElementaryEmbedding}_S(j,M,N)\\)</span> 保留非平凡类初等嵌入接口。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ClassCriticalPoint}_S(j,\\kappa)\">\\(\\operatorname{ClassCriticalPoint}_S(j,\\kappa)\\)</span> 为下式给出的类图临界点关系；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{crit}(j)\">\\(\\operatorname{crit}(j)\\)</span> 只在唯一临界点存在的定义域上使用。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ord}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ord}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"1d8adfba370086ed\" href=\"?note=1d8adfba370086ed\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-ordclass.md\">../batch10/58-df-ordclass.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}class\\text{-}elementary\\text{-}embedding}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{meta}}{}\n&amp;\\operatorname{ElementaryClassEmbedding}^{\\mathrm{sch}}_S(j,M,N)\\leftrightarrow{}\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{Class}_S(j)\\land\\mathrm{Class}_S(M)\\land\\mathrm{Class}_S(N)\\\\\n&amp;\\land j\\subseteq M\\times N\n\\land\\forall x\\in M\\;\\exists!y\\in N\\;(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in j)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\bigwedge_{\\substack{n\\in\\omega\\\\\n\\varphi(v_0,\\ldots,v_{n-1})\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_{\\in})}}\n\\;\\forall a_0,\\ldots,a_{n-1}\\in M\\;\\Bigl(\n\\langle M,\\in\\rangle\\models\\varphi[a_0,\\ldots,a_{n-1}]\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\langle N,\\in\\rangle\\models\\varphi[j(a_0),\\ldots,j(a_{n-1})]\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}class\\text{-}elementary\\text{-}embedding}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{meta}}{}\n&amp;\\operatorname{ElementaryClassEmbedding}^{\\mathrm{sch}}_S(j,M,N)\\leftrightarrow{}\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{Class}_S(j)\\land\\mathrm{Class}_S(M)\\land\\mathrm{Class}_S(N)\\\\\n&amp;\\land j\\subseteq M\\times N\n\\land\\forall x\\in M\\;\\exists!y\\in N\\;(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in j)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\bigwedge_{\\substack{n\\in\\omega\\\\\n\\varphi(v_0,\\ldots,v_{n-1})\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_{\\in})}}\n\\;\\forall a_0,\\ldots,a_{n-1}\\in M\\;\\Bigl(\n\\langle M,\\in\\rangle\\models\\varphi[a_0,\\ldots,a_{n-1}]\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\langle N,\\in\\rangle\\models\\varphi[j(a_0),\\ldots,j(a_{n-1})]\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}class\\text{-}elementary\\text{-}embedding\\text{-}alias}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{meta}}\n\\operatorname{ClassElementaryEmbedding}_S(j,M,N)\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{ElementaryClassEmbedding}^{\\mathrm{sch}}_S(j,M,N)\n\\land\\exists x\\in M\\;(j(x)\\ne x).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}class\\text{-}elementary\\text{-}embedding\\text{-}alias}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{meta}}\n\\operatorname{ClassElementaryEmbedding}_S(j,M,N)\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{ElementaryClassEmbedding}^{\\mathrm{sch}}_S(j,M,N)\n\\land\\exists x\\in M\\;(j(x)\\ne x).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}class\\text{-}critical\\text{-}point}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{meta}}\n\\operatorname{ClassCriticalPoint}_S(j,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Ord}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\exists y\\in V\\;(\\langle\\kappa,y\\rangle\\in j\\land y\\ne\\kappa)\n\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\kappa\\;(\\langle\\alpha,\\alpha\\rangle\\in j).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}class\\text{-}critical\\text{-}point}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{meta}}\n\\operatorname{ClassCriticalPoint}_S(j,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Ord}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\exists y\\in V\\;(\\langle\\kappa,y\\rangle\\in j\\land y\\ne\\kappa)\n\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\kappa\\;(\\langle\\alpha,\\alpha\\rangle\\in j).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}class\\text{-}critical\\text{-}point\\text{-}value}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{meta}}\n\\exists!\\kappa\\in V\\;\\operatorname{ClassCriticalPoint}_S(j,\\kappa)\n\\to\\forall\\kappa\\in V\\;(\\operatorname{crit}(j)=\\kappa\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{ClassCriticalPoint}_S(j,\\kappa)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}class\\text{-}critical\\text{-}point\\text{-}value}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{meta}}\n\\exists!\\kappa\\in V\\;\\operatorname{ClassCriticalPoint}_S(j,\\kappa)\n\\to\\forall\\kappa\\in V\\;(\\operatorname{crit}(j)=\\kappa\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{ClassCriticalPoint}_S(j,\\kappa)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The superscript <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{sch}\">\\(\\mathrm{sch}\\)</span> marks a metatheoretic scheme, one equivalence for each first-order formula; it is not a set-coded satisfaction predicate.</li>\n<li>This class-level schema accepts the proper class <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span>. The set-coded <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_S\\)</span> predicate does not.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch11/58-df-class.md","status":"resolved","id":"ca2a9c9166fa8cce","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-class.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-class-satisfaction.md","status":"resolved","id":"9976e7d9d98187f6","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-class-satisfaction.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-ordclass.md","status":"resolved","id":"1d8adfba370086ed","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-ordclass.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_{\\in})$ (formula set, see [[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-class.md","status":"resolved","id":"ca2a9c9166fa8cce","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Class}_S$ (definable-class predicate, see [[../batch11/58-df-class.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-class-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"9976e7d9d98187f6","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\bigwedge_{\\varphi}$ 是元语言模式，按 [[58-df-class-satisfaction]] 的有限公式递归解释每一个成员结构满意式；$\\vdash_{\\mathrm{meta}}$ 不是 ZFC 中的统一类真谓词。","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-ordclass.md","status":"resolved","id":"1d8adfba370086ed","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{Ord}$ 取 [[../batch10/58-df-ordclass.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M,N,j\\in\\mathsf{Cls}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_{\\in}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_{\\in})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Class}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ElementaryClassEmbedding}^{\\mathrm{sch}}_S\\subseteq\\mathsf{Cls}^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\bigwedge_{\\varphi}","display":false},{"tex":"\\vdash_{\\mathrm{meta}}","display":false},{"tex":"j(a)","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi(v_0,\\ldots,v_{n-1})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FV}_{\\mathcal L_\\in}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{v_i:i<n\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ClassElementaryEmbedding}_S(j,M,N)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ClassCriticalPoint}_S(j,\\kappa)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{crit}(j)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ord}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}class\\text{-}elementary\\text{-}embedding}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{meta}}{}\n&\\operatorname{ElementaryClassEmbedding}^{\\mathrm{sch}}_S(j,M,N)\\leftrightarrow{}\\\\\n&\\mathrm{Class}_S(j)\\land\\mathrm{Class}_S(M)\\land\\mathrm{Class}_S(N)\\\\\n&\\land j\\subseteq M\\times N\n\\land\\forall x\\in M\\;\\exists!y\\in N\\;(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in j)\\\\\n&\\land\\bigwedge_{\\substack{n\\in\\omega\\\\\n\\varphi(v_0,\\ldots,v_{n-1})\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_{\\in})}}\n\\;\\forall a_0,\\ldots,a_{n-1}\\in M\\;\\Bigl(\n\\langle M,\\in\\rangle\\models\\varphi[a_0,\\ldots,a_{n-1}]\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\langle N,\\in\\rangle\\models\\varphi[j(a_0),\\ldots,j(a_{n-1})]\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}class\\text{-}elementary\\text{-}embedding\\text{-}alias}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{meta}}\n\\operatorname{ClassElementaryEmbedding}_S(j,M,N)\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{ElementaryClassEmbedding}^{\\mathrm{sch}}_S(j,M,N)\n\\land\\exists x\\in M\\;(j(x)\\ne x).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}class\\text{-}critical\\text{-